<view class="page-shell">
  <text class="eyebrow">First visit</text>
  <view class="title">连接你的瑜伽账号</view>
  <view class="muted">仅首次使用需要验证已有会员或教练账号。密码不会保存在小程序中。</view>
  <view class="panel bind-form">
    <text class="bind-form__label">用户名</text>
    <input class="bind-form__input" maxlength="64" bindinput="updateUsername" placeholder="请输入用户名" />
    <text class="bind-form__label">密码</text>
    <input class="bind-form__input" password maxlength="128" key="{{passwordKey}}" bindinput="updatePassword" placeholder="请输入密码" />
    <text wx:if="{{error}}" class="bind-form__error">{{error}}</text>
    <button class="primary-button" loading="{{pending}}" disabled="{{pending || !username || !password}}" bindtap="submit">绑定并进入</button>
    <button class="bind-form__restart" disabled="{{pending}}" bindtap="restart">重新获取微信登录凭证</button>
  </view>
</view>
